## Guarantees and refusals · `sec:bindings:guarantees`

Original checks precede simplification, including operands beneath zero, cancellation or inactive declarations. An untyped zero cannot supply missing physical meaning. Point minus point produces a difference; point plus point and multiplicative point operations refuse. Counts retain their declared integer domains and are never silently rounded into continuous values. Equal dimensions, equal numbers and equal reporting names establish neither source identity nor independence.

Exact scales use bounded CAS constant algebra and conservative definedness/positivity checks. A mathematically positive expression can refuse when the available rules cannot prove it. Non-rational definitions remain exact; rational-only exports refuse instead of approximating them. A frozen snapshot proves descriptor validity, not numerical domain safety, uncertainty propagation, physical model adequacy or an assurance claim.

Companions retain their distinct kinds and ordered targets. Covariance uses both difference measures; its evaluation error targets the covariance parameter itself. A symbolic nonzero hypothesis cannot establish that a runtime divisor box excludes zero. Closed sensitivity recipes require independently replayed CAS results and keep unresolved numerical premises explicit. Exhaustion and unsupported fragments remain typed failures, with finite work, depth, occurrence and output-byte limits.

## Current scope and limits · `sec:bindings:scope`

The implemented surface includes scalar descriptors and original-expression checks, exact measures with π/e constants, frequency relations, frozen evidence, formal pairings, bounded coordinate exports, native square/reciprocal/positive-root/solve sensitivities, homogeneous symbol admission, physical affine reading definitions with checked overlap replay, companion/source/representation evidence, and exact affine/native ordered operator contracts. The homogeneous recipe accepts coherent concrete differences and refuses points, heterogeneous entries and formal quotients even if their dimensions agree. Its restriction is a recipe predicate, not a law of float storage.

The native LC operator/root route retains one original cached derivative and complete joint-source evidence; the quantity ω₀ chain retains its own complete correlated model, and certified native π conversion transports both covariance axes (`sec:bindings:lc-target`). Their positive/refusal evidence and remaining adapters are listed in the route table in `docs/design/lc-resonance.md`. `ReadingSourceMap` supplies checked mapped/copied/overlapping ancestry in an explicit original source order (`rule:bindings:paired-original-source-maps`); matrix consumes it through a separate typed LC adapter. General nonidentity physical LC input lowering, fixed-direction statistical subsets and arbitrary root moment companions remain separate integration work. Numerical inventory receipts cover scoped matrix owners, not a complete engine footprint. Shape and source semantics still partly live in matrix. Bindings executes no numerical expression, allocates no heap region and supplies no general implicit-function or numerical enclosure theorem. Exact judgments are machine-independent; numerical runs agree within tracked error under their admitted models.

